
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Finance & Investment Blog</title>

    <style>


        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f6f8;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }


        header {
            background: #0b3d2e;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;

            /* CSS3 Rounded Corners */
            border-radius: 0 0 30px 30px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 5px;
        }



        nav {
            background: #222;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav li {
            padding: 15px 20px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav li:hover {
            background: #0b3d2e;
        }



        .hero {
            padding: 55px;
            text-align: center;

            /*
             Multiple background images.
             First image is the front layer.
             Second image is the back layer.
            */
            background-image:
                url("https://picsum.photos/1200/500?finance"),
                linear-gradient(#dff3e8, #b8dfca);

            background-position:
                center,
                center;

            background-repeat:
                no-repeat,
                no-repeat;

            /*
             background-size demonstrates
             cover and fixed sizing.
            */
            background-size:
                cover,
                cover;

            min-height: 300px;

            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 20px;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            color: #0b3d2e;
            font-size: 30px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 18px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }



        .container {
            display: flex;
            padding: 25px;
            gap: 25px;
        }



        .sidebar {
            width: 25%;
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;

            /* Rounded corners */
            border-radius: 20px;

            /*
             Border Image
             Make sure border.png is in
             the same folder as this HTML file.
            */
            border: 15px solid transparent;
            border-image: url("border.png") 30 round;
        }

        .sidebar h3 {
            color: #0b3d2e;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .sidebar ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .sidebar li {
            padding: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .sidebar li:hover {
            background: #dff3e8;
        }


        .content {
            width: 75%;
        }

        .content h2 {
            color: #0b3d2e;
        }


        .cards {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            flex: 1;
            background: white;
            padding: 15px;

            /* Rounded corners */
            border-radius: 20px;

            text-align: center;

            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ccc;

            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 180px;

            /*
             Background-size concept is also
             demonstrated through object-fit.
            */
            object-fit: cover;

            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: #0b3d2e;
        }

        .card p {
            margin-top: 8px;
        }


        .investment-name {
            color: #0b3d2e;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .investment-img {
            width: 100px;
            height: 70px;
            object-fit: cover;

            opacity: 0.3;

            border-radius: 10px;

            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }


        .investment-name:hover + .investment-img {
            opacity: 1;
        }


        button {
            background: #0b3d2e;
            color: white;

            padding: 10px 20px;

            border: none;

            margin-top: 12px;

            border-radius: 8px;

            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #06251c;
        }


        .form-section {
            background: white;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 25px;

            border-radius: 20px;

            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ccc;
        }

        .form-section h2 {
            color: #0b3d2e;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .form-section label {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .form-section input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;

            margin-top: 5px;

            border: 2px solid #ccc;

            border-radius: 8px;

            font-size: 16px;
        }


        .form-section input:required {
            border: 2px solid #0b3d2e;
            background: #fffef0;
        }


        .form-section input:focus {
            outline: none;

            border: 3px solid #0b3d2e;

            background: #e9ffe9;
        }


        .form-section input:valid {
            color: #0b3d2e;
        }

        .form-section input:invalid {
            color: red;
        }


        .table-section {
            margin-top: 30px;

            background: white;

            padding: 25px;

            border-radius: 20px;

            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ccc;
        }

        .table-section h2 {
            color: #0b3d2e;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        #investmentTable {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        #investmentTable th,
        #investmentTable td {
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
        }

        #investmentTable th {
            background: #0b3d2e;
            color: white;
        }

        #investmentTable tr:nth-child(odd) {
            background: #f2f2f2;
        }


        #investmentTable tr:nth-child(even) {
            background: #dff3e8;
        }


        #investmentTable tr:hover {
            background: #ffd966;
        }


        footer {
            background: #222;
            color: white;

            padding: 25px;

            text-align: center;

            margin-top: 20px;

            border-radius: 25px 25px 0 0;
        }


        @media screen and (max-width: 992px) {

            .container {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .sidebar,
            .content {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .cards {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .card {
                width: 45%;
            }

        }




        @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {

            nav ul {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }

            nav li {
                padding: 12px;
            }

            .cards {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .card {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 35px 20px;
            }

            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 25px;
            }

            .container {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

        }


        /* =========================================
           SMALL MOBILE
        ========================================= */

        @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {

            header h1 {
                font-size: 25px;
            }

            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 21px;
            }

            button {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 15px;
            }

            .form-section,
            .table-section {
                padding: 15px;
            }

        }

    </style>

</head>


<body>


    <!-- =========================================
         HEADER
    ========================================== -->

    <header>

        <h1>Finance & Investment Blog</h1>

        <p>Learn. Invest. Grow.</p>

    </header>


    <!-- =========================================
         NAVIGATION
    ========================================== -->

    <nav>

        <ul>

            <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>

            <li><a href="#">Stocks</a></li>

            <li><a href="#">Mutual Funds</a></li>

            <li><a href="#">Personal Finance</a></li>

            <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>

        </ul>

    </nav>


    <!-- =========================================
         HERO
         Multiple Backgrounds
         Background Size: Cover
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="hero">

        <h2>Build Your Financial Future</h2>

        <p>
            Learn about investing, saving, stocks, mutual funds,
            and smart money management.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         MAIN CONTAINER
    ========================================== -->

    <div class="container">


        <!-- =====================================
             SIDEBAR
             Border Image + Border Radius
        ====================================== -->

        <div class="sidebar">

            <h3>Investment Categories</h3>

            <ul>

                <li>Stock Market</li>

                <li>Mutual Funds</li>

                <li>Personal Finance</li>

                <li>Bonds</li>

                <li>Cryptocurrency</li>

                <li>Retirement Planning</li>

            </ul>

        </div>


        <!-- =====================================
             MAIN CONTENT
        ====================================== -->

        <div class="content">

            <h2>Latest Financial Articles</h2>

            <p>
                Explore our latest articles and learn how to make
                better financial and investment decisions.
            </p>


            <!-- =================================
                 CARDS
            ================================== -->

            <div class="cards">


                <!-- CARD 1 -->

                <div class="card">

                    <img
                        src="stockmarket.jpg"
                        alt="Stock Market">

                    <h3>Stock Market</h3>

                    <p>
                        Understand the basics of stock market
                        investing and how stocks work.
                    </p>

                    <button>Read Article</button>

                </div>


                <!-- CARD 2 -->

                <div class="card">

                    <img
                        src="mutual funds.jpg"
                        alt="Mutual Funds">

                    <h3>Mutual Funds</h3>

                    <p>
                        Learn how mutual funds work and how
                        investors can build diversified portfolios.
                    </p>

                    <button>Read Article</button>

                </div>


                <!-- CARD 3 -->

                <div class="card">

                    <img
                        src="personalfinance.jpg"
                        alt="Personal Finance">

                    <h3>Personal Finance</h3>

                    <p>
                        Discover simple ways to save money,
                        manage expenses, and plan your future.
                    </p>

                    <button>Read Article</button>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- =================================
                 ADJACENT SIBLING DEMONSTRATION
            ================================== -->

            <div class="form-section">

                <h2>Investment Highlights</h2>

                <p class="investment-name">
                    Hover over this text to reveal the image:
                </p>

                <img
                    class="investment-img"
                    src="https://picsum.photos/200/120?finance"
                    alt="Investment">

                <p style="margin-top:15px;">
                    This demonstrates the CSS3 adjacent sibling
                    selector using <b>A + B</b>.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- =================================
                 PSEUDO-CLASS FORM
                 :focus
                 :required
                 :valid
                 :invalid
            ================================== -->

            <div class="form-section">

                <h2>Subscribe to Financial Updates</h2>

                <form>

                    <label for="name">
                        Name:
                    </label>

                    <input
                        type="text"
                        id="name"
                        placeholder="Enter your name"
                        required>


                    <label for="email">
                        Email:
                    </label>

                    <input
                        type="email"
                        id="email"
                        placeholder="name@example.com"
                        required>


                    <button type="submit">
                        Subscribe
                    </button>

                </form>

                <p style="margin-top:15px;">
                    Try entering an invalid email and then a valid
                    email to see the <b>:invalid</b> and
                    <b>:valid</b> pseudo-classes.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- =================================
                 NTH-CHILD TABLE
            ================================== -->

            <div class="table-section">

                <h2>Popular Investment Options</h2>

                <table id="investmentTable">

                    <tr>
                        <th>Investment</th>
                        <th>Risk</th>
                        <th>Expected Return</th>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td>Stocks</td>
                        <td>High</td>
                        <td>12%</td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td>Mutual Funds</td>
                        <td>Medium</td>
                        <td>10%</td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td>Bonds</td>
                        <td>Low</td>
                        <td>7%</td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td>Fixed Deposits</td>
                        <td>Low</td>
                        <td>6%</td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td>Gold</td>
                        <td>Medium</td>
                        <td>8%</td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td>Real Estate</td>
                        <td>Medium</td>
                        <td>9%</td>
                    </tr>

                </table>

                <p style="margin-top:15px;">
                    The table uses <b>:nth-child(odd)</b> and
                    <b>:nth-child(even)</b> to create alternating
                    row colors. Hover over a row to highlight it.
                </p>

            </div>


        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================================
         FOOTER
    ========================================== -->

    <footer>

        <h3>Finance & Investment Blog</h3>

        <p>
            Learn today. Invest wisely. Grow tomorrow.
        </p>

        <p>
            © 2026 Finance & Investment Blog
        </p>

    </footer>


</body>

</html>
```
